# Wipeout Pulse's pause screen over a Time Trial on Moa Therma White (Venom), played through our own menus: RACEBOX, the race page's
# TIME TRIAL, Track Select, Ship Select. START pauses the race and opens the disc's own `InGame Pause SP Time Trial`. `@OUT@` is the
# screenshot path and `@TICKS@` the race ticks to play, which `compare_menu.drive_command` and `psp-menu-pair.py` fill in. Run with
# `--original-menu` and `--no-intro`.
boot
select racebox; press cross; until page=race
set race.mode=time_trial
select launch_race; press cross
until screen=picker; select 03_Track; press cross
until screen.id=ship-select; press cross
until stage=race within 6000
ticks @TICKS@
press start
ticks 120
draw
screenshot @OUT@
quit
